### ==============================================================================
### COLLECTION: Staff (Chi danh cho Admin)
### ==============================================================================
@BASE_URL = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Dang nhap Admin de lay Token
# @name adminLogin
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shop.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### 2. Ten API: Staff List (Ky vong 200 OK)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 3. Ten API: Staff Creation (Ky vong 201 Created)
# @name createNewStaff
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tran Van Thu Ngan 2",
  "email": "staff2@shop.com",
  "phone": "0981122334",
  "password": "password123"
}

@newStaffId = {{createNewStaff.response.body.data.id}}


### 4. Ten API: Staff Status Toggle (Khoa tai khoan, Ky vong 200 OK, isActive = false)
PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/api/staff/{{newStaffId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


### 5. Ten API: Staff Deletion (Ky vong 200 OK)
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/api/staff/{{newStaffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

